    "rationale": "The user decided to keep the fine-tuned Local artifact as an experiment. The fine-tune improved every measured axis and produced no missed deny on either partition, but the synthetic gain is largely same-generator cue matching and the 16-case real anchor carries only allow labels, so this evidence cannot yet show the model is safely permissive."
  },
