    "programmatic_provider_used": false
  },
  "limitations": [
    "Synthetic validation and the 470 training samples come from the same generator and state their decisive cue almost verbatim, so high synthetic agreement partly measures cue matching rather than general approval judgment.",
    "Every holdout teacher label and every independent judge call on the holdout is allow, so the 16-case anchor can detect over-blocking and structured-output failure but cannot detect over-permissiveness.",
    "The judge also develops this project; the independence flaw is accepted and recorded rather than mitigated.",
    "The subscription-side judge model is not frozen by this repository, so every judge result is a point-in-time judgment and is not claimed to be reproducible.",
    "Ten of the 130 frozen Sol synthetic targets were judged blind to have weak rationales because they assert specifics, such as a checksum mismatch or a dry-run result, that the supplied evidence does not contain; their outcomes were still supported.",
    "The holdout partition uses a holdout-only terminal-carrying judge contract because two recorded terminals carry no decision; its counts are therefore not comparable with the synthetic partition and the two are never combined."
  ],
